flowchart TD
  D[Scenario families] --> S[Family-level split]
  S --> H[Independent human review]
  H --> P[Context plus preferred and rejected response]
  P --> F[Frozen pretrained reference LM]
  P --> T[Trainable copy of same LM]
  F --> L[DPO pairwise preference loss]
  T --> L
  L --> T
  T --> E[Held-out counterfactual evaluation]
  E --> Q{Relational gains without factual regression?}
  Q -- Yes --> N[Replicate across new seeds and families]
  Q -- No --> R[Revise data or falsify hypothesis]
